        lines {
          text: "                        text = \"Because modern apps like Instagram run in sandboxed processes, standard Android digital wellness tools use Android\'s AccessibilityService API and System Window Overlays.\\n\\n\342\200\242 Timed Mindfulness Nudge: FocusGuard tracks time spent inside Reels or the Main Feed. When the threshold (e.g. 30s) is reached, a gentle mindfulness overlay pops up prompting you to take a breath or return home.\\n\342\200\242 Smart Back Action: If selected, FocusGuard issues a back gesture with a 30s safety cooldown to prevent repeating loops.\\n\342\200\242 Why Overlays: Android\'s security model prevents external apps from modifying third-party binaries or layouts directly. System Overlays provide the cleanest, safest, and most reliable digital wellbeing solution.\","
          type: UNIFIED_DIFF_LINE_TYPE_UNCHANGED
        }
